# v1.28 FLEET RETRAIN — the interrogative cycle (docs/interrogative-cycle.md), a BREAK.
#
# WHY. Owner chose route (i) 2026-09-14 after information (DONE-heard: unused
# at every price), price (root_done_false=-0.1: buys formation, not the mode)
# and drag were each measured to their end. Four commits on multi-agent-dev
# (46bb775 vocabulary, ebe3228 exchange, e00846d observations, 10211a7 read
# machinery; 00a2372 smoke) changed both spaces: OBS_DIM 357 -> 361 (+4
# status-COMPLETE-heard, appended) and N_ACTIONS 239 -> 240 (REQUEST_STATUS
# appended). Every v1.27-tree checkpoint is orphaned, stated in the spec
# before the build.
#
# WHAT THE CYCLE SHIPS. One non-penalized interrogative: a leader broadcasts
# REPORT STATUS, its living direct subordinates auto-answer their own mission
# state (is_complete on their own context — never the root's success
# condition), and COMPLETE answers light a 10-step obs window. Priced at
# transmission_cost + an 8-step cooldown; no verdict, no stake. No reward
# term added or changed.
#
# THE READ IS PRE-REGISTERED: docs/interrogative-cycle.md §"The read" —
# scored by scripts/interrogative_read.py, thresholds pinned by test BEFORE
# this file launches. Usage gates first; spam is named SPAM.
#
# cohort/ is FROZEN from the first launch below until the last job lands.
